    "detailed_description": "Game Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSeasonal Themes: Experience the beauty of the changing seasons with four distinct chapters\u2014Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter. Each season features unique visual styles and musical atmospheres, offering a full experience of nature\u2019s transformation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreative Puzzles: Each chapter presents unique puzzle objectives, such as drawing heart-shaped branches, intricate interweaving patterns, sturdy tree forms, and circular branches, representing different stages of love.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBeautiful Blossoms: Successfully solve puzzles to make the branches bloom with cherry blossoms, roses, chrysanthemums, and plum blossoms. These flowers symbolize the sweetness of first love, the passion of a romantic relationship, steadfastness in everyday life, and the eternity of love.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTouching Story: The game vividly narrates the growth and changes of love through exquisite visuals and narration, allowing you to embark on a beautiful journey of love while solving puzzles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse your mouse to draw the growth path of branches on the canvas.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSolve each puzzle based on hints and intuition to complete the branch patterns.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy unique visual effects and soundscapes with each seasonal puzzle, enhancing immersion and challenge.",
    "about_the_game": "Game Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSeasonal Themes: Experience the beauty of the changing seasons with four distinct chapters\u2014Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter. Each season features unique visual styles and musical atmospheres, offering a full experience of nature\u2019s transformation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreative Puzzles: Each chapter presents unique puzzle objectives, such as drawing heart-shaped branches, intricate interweaving patterns, sturdy tree forms, and circular branches, representing different stages of love.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBeautiful Blossoms: Successfully solve puzzles to make the branches bloom with cherry blossoms, roses, chrysanthemums, and plum blossoms. These flowers symbolize the sweetness of first love, the passion of a romantic relationship, steadfastness in everyday life, and the eternity of love.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTouching Story: The game vividly narrates the growth and changes of love through exquisite visuals and narration, allowing you to embark on a beautiful journey of love while solving puzzles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse your mouse to draw the growth path of branches on the canvas.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSolve each puzzle based on hints and intuition to complete the branch patterns.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy unique visual effects and soundscapes with each seasonal puzzle, enhancing immersion and challenge.",
    "short_description": "Players unlock the beautiful blossoms of each season by drawing branches on the canvas. The game features four chapters\u2014Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter\u2014each representing a different stage of love, from the budding of first love to the eternity of affection.",
